§ `reg 29(6) to (9): anonymous accounts and open-ended investment companies (src:885-894)`
#ASSERT `reg 29(6) the relevant person may set up an anonymous account, an anonymous passbook or an anonymous safe-deposit box for a new or existing customer` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(6) the relevant person may set up an anonymous account, an anonymous passbook or an anonymous safe-deposit box for a new or existing customer` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 29(6) the relevant person may set up an anonymous account, an anonymous passbook or an anonymous safe-deposit box for a new or existing customer` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
