#ASSERT `reg 29(7) the relevant person must apply customer due diligence measures to the anonymous account or passbook` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(7) the relevant person must apply customer due diligence measures to the anonymous account or passbook` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
