#ASSERT `reg 29(7A) the relevant person has applied customer due diligence measures to the anonymous safe-deposit box` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (9) arguments: the date the application was made; the date it was determined (the Regulations came into force on 26 June 2017)
