§ `reg 29(10) to (13): pooled accounts (src:895-901)`
-- (10) arguments: the relevant person provides a customer with a new pooled account; the date it provides it; the day on which paragraph (10) comes into force
#ASSERT `reg 29(10) paragraphs (11) to (17) apply` TRUE (Date 10 1 2020) (Date 10 1 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(10) paragraphs (11) to (17) apply` TRUE (Date 11 1 2020) (Date 10 1 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(10) paragraphs (11) to (17) apply` TRUE (Date 9 1 2020) (Date 10 1 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(10) paragraphs (11) to (17) apply` FALSE (Date 11 1 2020) (Date 10 1 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person must take the steps that paragraph (11) requires` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person must take the steps that paragraph (11) requires` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person must take the steps that paragraph (11) requires` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person must take the steps that paragraph (11) requires` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person must take the steps that paragraph (11) requires` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person has taken the steps that paragraph (11) requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person has taken the steps that paragraph (11) requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person has taken the steps that paragraph (11) requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(11) the relevant person has taken the steps that paragraph (11) requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(12) the relevant person has considered the appropriateness of imposing controls on the pooled account` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(12) the relevant person has considered the appropriateness of imposing controls on the pooled account` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(12) the relevant person has considered the appropriateness of imposing controls on the pooled account` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(12) the relevant person has considered the appropriateness of imposing controls on the pooled account` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(13) the relevant person is able to demonstrate to its supervisory authority that the extent of the measures is appropriate` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(13) the relevant person is able to demonstrate to its supervisory authority that the extent of the measures is appropriate` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `reg 29(14) to (18): the customer's duties (src:902-906)`
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer must make information on the persons on whose behalf monies are held available to the relevant person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer must make information on the persons on whose behalf monies are held available to the relevant person` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer must make information on the persons on whose behalf monies are held available to the relevant person` NOTHING TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer must make information on the persons on whose behalf monies are held available to the relevant person` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer must make information on the persons on whose behalf monies are held available to the relevant person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer must make information on the persons on whose behalf monies are held available to the relevant person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer has made the information available to the relevant person` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer has made the information available to the relevant person` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(14) the customer has made the information available to the relevant person` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the customer must maintain accurate and up-to-date records in writing of the monies paid into and out of the pooled account` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the customer must maintain accurate and up-to-date records in writing of the monies paid into and out of the pooled account` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the customer must maintain accurate and up-to-date records in writing of the monies paid into and out of the pooled account` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the fifth anniversary of the date on which the payment is complete` (Date 15 3 2022) EQUALS Date 15 3 2027
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the fifth anniversary of the date on which the payment is complete` (Date 31 12 2020) EQUALS Date 31 12 2025
-- (15) arguments: the date the payment is complete; the last day on which the records were maintained
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the customer maintained the records of the payment for the whole period of five years` (Date 15 3 2022) (Date 14 3 2027) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the customer maintained the records of the payment for the whole period of five years` (Date 15 3 2022) (Date 15 3 2027) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the customer maintained the records of the payment for the whole period of five years` (Date 15 3 2022) (Date 13 3 2027) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the customer maintained the records of the payment for the whole period of five years` (Date 31 12 2020) (Date 30 12 2025) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(15) the customer maintained the records of the payment for the whole period of five years` (Date 31 12 2020) (Date 29 12 2025) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(16) the customer must provide information about itself and the pooled account to the law enforcement authority` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 29(16) the customer must provide information about itself and the pooled account to the law enforcement authority` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 29(16) the customer must provide information about itself and the pooled account to the law enforcement authority` NOTHING TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
